Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.08,0:02:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第7季第6集]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.42,0:00:03.27,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.52,0:00:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 鲍比·辛格吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello? - Bobby Singer?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.15,0:00:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的医生是个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}My surgeon is a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.25,0:00:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你快来苏福尔斯综合医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please get your ass here to Sioux Falls General.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.99,0:00:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就像易形者\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're like shapeshifters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.42,0:00:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是更爱吃人肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}only a lot more into eating folk.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.69,0:00:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且没有东西能杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And nothing can kill 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.37,0:00:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么别的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.40,0:00:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,有 他们流出的是黑色的胶状物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep. They bleed black goo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.35,0:00:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.99,0:00:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.06,0:00:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,咒语只能维持数日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spell only lasts for a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.38,0:00:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想说出的那些心事不会自行消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}The stuff you don't talk about doesn't just go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.49,0:00:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你究竟想说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then what the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.38,0:00:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是指你不想说的那件心事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking about whatever you're not telling me about.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.42,0:00:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以交心的 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're good, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.63,0:00:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.58,0:00:49.90,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.58,0:00:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.99,0:01:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.96,0:01:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好 梅根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning… Megan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.85,0:01:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这件衣服真漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is a really, really pretty dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.05,0:01:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢夸奖 这件衣服有年头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. It's vintage.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.39,0:01:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿在你身上显得很新\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it looks new on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.84,0:01:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你嘴真甜 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you sweet, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.01,0:01:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫我迪恩就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call me Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.27,0:01:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么需要我帮忙 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can I help you today, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.12,0:01:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这家银行没有账户\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't actually have an account at this bank,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.02,0:01:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能不能想法子\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I was wondering if there was any way…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这张换成零钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could get change for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.52,0:01:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以专门为你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I can make an exception…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.19,0:01:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞点特殊\N{\fnArial\fs30}just for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.29,0:01:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.86,0:01:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想换成什么面值的 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you want it, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.38,0:01:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不还是改天吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm gonna have to take a rain check…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.53,0:01:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你们的钱都交出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all your money.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.09,0:01:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手举起来 把手举起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hands in the air! Hands in the air!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.87,0:01:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的钱保过险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your money's insured,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.83,0:02:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以就别想逞英雄了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so no heroes, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.82,0:02:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去吧你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.86,0:02:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.39,0:02:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.73,0:02:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 切特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Chet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.89,0:02:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,来尝尝毒树之果的滋味如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see how you like a little fruit of the poison tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.45,0:02:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不只是个法律术语吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that just a legal expression?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.90,0:02:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,想得倒美\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna wish it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.21,0:02:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oaky.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.28,0:02:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟圣水的滋味有点像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Similar finish to holy water,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.94,0:03:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不像岩盐那么苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}not as bitter as rock salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.45,0:03:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最喜欢的两具肉身还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how are my two favorite meat-sicles?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.63,0:03:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还喘气儿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he still sucking air?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.17,0:03:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么打都死不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Greatest hits didn't do the trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.45,0:03:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,就差没用二流的音乐折磨他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm down to B-sides and deep cuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.01,0:03:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好快点找出办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you better figure out something quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.01,0:03:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个什么巫师在他身上施的咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}That whammy that witch dude put on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.32,0:03:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能撑几天而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}is only gonna last for a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.13,0:03:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦他恢复元气\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gets his spinach back,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.93,0:03:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,想拦住他 就只能拿汽车砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're gonna end up having to drop a car on him just to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.68,0:03:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.18,0:03:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃德加从车底下爬出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edgar walked away from that car.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.85,0:03:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他毫发无损\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.82,0:03:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽说他有点生你们的气 但…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he is a little pissed at you, but …
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.62,0:03:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还不知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.74,0:03:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭上你的臭嘴吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you shut your caketrap?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.65,0:03:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.55,0:03:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你用了这么多招 他还是不肯开口吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been using all this stuff and he still won't talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.84,0:03:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了您呐 教练\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huddle over, coach?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.91,0:03:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么找到我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you find us?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.71,0:03:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,很简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.10,0:03:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用了图像识别软件\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used pattern-recognition software.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.37,0:04:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有基础启发性算法 查到了你们的化名\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a basic heuristic algorithm to track your known aliases.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.58,0:04:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.35,0:04:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,怕什么来什么 还是个高智商怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just what we need … a Mensa monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.64,0:04:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.78,0:04:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们从头说起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just start with the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.21,0:04:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道我们的化名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd you get our aliases?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.56,0:04:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,从你们穿风衣的朋友那儿知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}From your trench-coated friend, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.98,0:04:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在「小卡营」驻扎的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we were all nestled in at Camp Cass,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.54,0:04:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,下载了他脑子里的全部资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}kind of got the full download.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.53,0:04:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就有这本事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's just how we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.71,0:04:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为什么要告诉我们呢 切特\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why are you talking to us, Chet?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.71,0:04:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又不傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.20,0:04:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要泄露国家机密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why you spilling state secrets?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.75,0:04:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我不怕你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I'm not scared of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.35,0:04:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们阻挡不了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.05,0:04:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我们谁都造不成威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't stop any of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.47,0:04:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有不死之身 你们这群傻帽\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't be killed, you stupid little chewtoys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.39,0:04:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们现在该担心的不是我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are aware that I'm the least of your concerns, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.97,0:04:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你们还没看今天的新闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't watched the news today, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.56,0:04:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,此前被认定为死亡的两人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The two men, who up until today were presumed dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.58,0:05:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,封锁出口 大开杀戒\N{\fnArial\fs30}locked the doors and opened fire,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.70,0:05:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,无人生还\N{\fnArial\fs30}leaving no survivors.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.11,0:05:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,加州对萨姆及迪恩·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam and Dean Winchester are now the subjects.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.83,0:05:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,展开了全面通缉\N{\fnArial\fs30}of a manhunt throughout the state of California.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.15,0:05:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩今早挺忙啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Busy morning, you two?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.59,0:05:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那俩混蛋变成咱们的模样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those sons of bitches xeroxed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.24,0:05:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是怎么做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't understand how.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.94,0:05:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.92,0:05:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能他们有人在医院碰了你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe one of 'em touched you at the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.64,0:05:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们用了头发\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.96,0:05:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,从旅馆淋浴下水口很容易搞到你们的DNA\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not too hard to lift some DNA out of a motel shower drain, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.48,0:05:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样就能克隆人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can copy people like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.68,0:05:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,真赞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.67,0:05:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们到底打算干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what is their plan, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.31,0:05:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,逼咱们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Squeeze us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.82,0:05:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,把咱们变成全美关注的焦点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn us into the most wanted men in America.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.89,0:05:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那就别怪咱们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Well, that settles it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.54,0:05:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是找到那俩混球 就亲手宰了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We find these ass monkeys, and we kill them ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.21,0:05:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.32,0:05:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,全国所有的执法机关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every form of law enforcement in the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.41,0:05:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,今早都见着你们的丑样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}has seen your ugly mugs this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.87,0:05:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 那还有啥必要躲躲藏藏的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly. So what's the point in trying to hide?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.34,0:05:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,总比伸出脖子找死强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better than sticking your fool neck out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.69,0:05:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些家伙比你们狡猾多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}These things are smarter than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.77,0:05:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 鲍比 这话可不好听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Geez, Bobby, don't sugarcoat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.96,0:05:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们根本不知道怎么杀它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have a clue how to kill 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.11,0:06:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是拖延时间 而你们的计划是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}or slow 'em down, and your plan is, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.14,0:06:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,正面交锋 算了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go right at 'em? Genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.23,0:06:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们装成我们的样子 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're wearing our faces, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.47,0:06:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这笔账必须算\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.04,0:06:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我赞成迪恩的说法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm with Dean here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.56,0:06:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 如果你们要做傻事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if you're gonna be stupid,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.64,0:06:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好是放机灵点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}you might as well be smart about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.93,0:06:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们得去见一个名叫弗兰克·德弗罗的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to see a fella named Frank Devereaux.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.56,0:06:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's he?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.95,0:06:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,傻子加疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a jackass and a lunatic,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.80,0:06:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,当年在休伦港他欠我个人情\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he owes me one, from back in Port Huron.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.80,0:06:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,与此同时\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the meantime,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.48,0:06:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要接着对付那个话痨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll keep working on chatty Cathy here,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.84,0:06:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看能不能找出杀死他的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}See if I can figure out what makes him die.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.88,0:06:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,老样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The usual?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.28,0:06:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,老样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rhymes with sing-songs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.80,0:06:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有没有蛋白棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys sell protein bars?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.12,0:07:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.76,0:07:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 我要去后面拿\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's in … it's in the back, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.50,0:07:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,请稍等一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just, uh, give me a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.29,0:07:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,行 谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.99,0:07:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个收银员肯定认出我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty sure the cashier just made me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.64,0:07:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.29,0:07:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.38,0:07:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.25,0:08:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是莫瑞斯特工 这位是瓦伦提\N{\fnArial\fs30}Special agent Morris. This is special agent Valente.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.19,0:08:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.07,0:08:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说温彻斯特兄弟很忙啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}These Winchester boys are keeping busy, I hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.74,0:08:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这算啥 杀人越货旅行团吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this, some type of psycho road trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.84,0:08:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二家银行了 外加便利店\N{\fnArial\fs30}The second bank, plus that convenience store?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.65,0:08:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们几天前还是死人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couple of days ago, they were dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.49,0:08:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不比你了解更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know about what you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.15,0:08:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,失陪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.11,0:08:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的连环杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actual serial killers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.62,0:08:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,有案子就有大量的文书工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crime spree means paperwork. Lots of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.87,0:08:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,有你忙的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which you'll be doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.34,0:08:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,该出发了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.66,0:08:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个加油站发现了他们的行踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winchesters spotted at a gas n' sip.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.28,0:08:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,距离这里有一千英里左右\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about a thousand miles from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.21,0:08:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,太快了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.47,0:08:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞过去的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must have flown.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.45,0:08:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么就是坐蝙蝠战车\N{\fnArial\fs30}That or batmobile.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.71,0:08:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定找对地方了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure this is the right place?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.18,0:08:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.03,0:09:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克 在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank, you in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.58,0:09:11.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.57,0:09:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.23,0:09:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.37,0:09:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗兰克 有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank, anybody here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.54,0:09:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.06,0:09:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在家吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody home?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.49,0:09:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.01,0:09:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜘蛛抓到飞虫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spider caught some flies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.42,0:10:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我勒个去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'll be darned.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.86,0:10:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是大白天作案的杀人狂啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Psycho butch and sundance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.75,0:10:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,CNN正在播你们的新闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're on CNN right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.58,0:10:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 那不是我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, t-that's not us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.38,0:10:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 不可能是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. Can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.53,0:10:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你们有传送器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you had a teleporter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.48,0:10:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有传送器吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have a teleporter?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.64,0:10:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}No…Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.87,0:10:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.60,0:10:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,沉痛哀悼你们有对疯子二重身啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, my condolences on the doppelgangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.16,0:10:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 谁派你们来的 国安局的蠢货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, who sent you? NSA? The feeb?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.03,0:10:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,畸形儿基金会\N{\fnArial\fs30}March of dimes?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.10,0:10:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是鲍比·辛格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Bobby Singer sent us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.42,0:10:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or not. Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.34,0:10:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说你可以帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}H-he said you could help.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.40,0:10:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还记得当年休伦港的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said you owed him, from Port Huron.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.52,0:10:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人救了你一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guy saves your life one time,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.78,0:10:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢 一辈子都欠着他了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, what, you owe him the rest of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.62,0:10:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 一般来说都是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's usually how it works, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.52,0:11:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.97,0:11:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道鲍比总搞些神神鬼鬼的事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that Bobby's into that magic hooey,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.78,0:11:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实是\N{\fnArial\fs30}but truth is,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.03,0:11:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,政府研究克隆人好多年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The government have been cloning people for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.66,0:11:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,没准轮到你们头上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess it was just your turn in the barrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.59,0:11:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 其实… - 别 听他说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, actually … - forget it. He's rolling.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.39,0:11:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的克隆人忙得很啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yours have been busy beavers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.16,0:11:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼看着你们就成了第二号通缉犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're number two on the most wanted list.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.18,0:11:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,自堂娜·萨默（美国黑人女歌手）以来爬得最快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quickest climb up the charts since Donna Summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.24,0:11:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你觉得我们该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you think we should do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.23,0:11:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个时节去古巴不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cuba's nice this time of year.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.23,0:11:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们不打算躲起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we're not hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.97,0:11:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从来就这么蠢吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he always this stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.29,0:11:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我们要留下来好好教训那两个家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we got to stick around and kick a couple asses.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.57,0:11:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,只需要你帮我们远离牢房\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we just need you to get us further off the grid,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.86,0:11:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时又能自由行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}but keep us on the board.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.39,0:11:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 第一件事就是清除以前所有的化名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, first thing we got to do is wipe all your old aliases.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.52,0:11:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能太高调\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more rock shoutouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.45,0:11:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,从现在开始就叫汤姆和约翰·史密斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Tom and John Smith from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.48,0:12:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能用卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}And no plastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.83,0:12:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,只用现金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cash only.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.78,0:12:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,要非常频繁 而且不定期地\N{\fnArial\fs30}And change your phones on a very frequent.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.65,0:12:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,换手机 明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}non-schedule schedule, you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.76,0:12:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 尽量避开政府有权调用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and try to stay out of view of the 200 million cameras.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.50,0:12:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,两亿个摄像头 明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the government has access to, 'kay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.90,0:12:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,两亿\N{\fnArial\fs30}200 million?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.11,0:12:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,老大哥（代指政府）嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.82,0:12:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的眼睛可多了 朋友们\N{\fnArial\fs30}he has many eyeballs, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.70,0:12:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要看到一个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see a place that even looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.18,0:12:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能有保安系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}it can afford security,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.57,0:12:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,二话不说就赶紧撤\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just ease on down the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.63,0:12:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}This…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.17,0:12:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你的笔记本 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your laptop, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.28,0:12:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 这是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. That's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.56,0:12:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我靠 喂 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}What … gee … hey …
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.42,0:12:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是干嘛呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you … what was that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.30,0:12:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我要谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.41,0:12:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题 你欠我五千块 现金\N{\fnArial\fs30}No problem. You owe me five grand, cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.12,0:12:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啥 - 啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.87,0:12:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还想到购物中心去货比三家吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you wanna go comparison shop at the mall,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.09,0:12:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,小可爱们\N{\fnArial\fs30}sweet cheeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.01,0:12:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,替我向条子问好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say hi to the cops for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.74,0:12:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.31,0:12:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来弄张新的证件照\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's blue steel you up some new I.D.,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.54,0:13:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位史密斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. and Mr. Smith.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.91,0:13:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来一次 来吧 再来一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it again! Come on, do it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.74,0:13:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算就这样在清晨抚摸我\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're just gonna touch me in the morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.49,0:13:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后转身离去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}then just walk away?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.64,0:13:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么还能说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you still talkin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.42,0:13:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还没玩厌吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you sick of this yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.10,0:13:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你流的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bleed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.87,0:13:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是黑色的…鼻涕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Black…snot, sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.77,0:13:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你会流血你就会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you bleed, you can die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.04,0:13:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,行啊 小伙子 随你怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, sport, whatever you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.12,0:13:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么不再试试酸呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try the acid again, why don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.26,0:13:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怜的家伙 你束手无策了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor sap. You're stumped.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.59,0:13:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,消停一下 话痨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it a rest, mouthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.18,0:13:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得一旦咒语失效\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long you think these'll hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.40,0:13:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些东西能撑多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}once the spell wears off, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.41,0:13:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间不多了 老头子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tick tock, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.56,0:13:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会好好享用你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna really enjoy eating you,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.77,0:13:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,连帽子也吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}right down to that hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.77,0:13:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.05,0:13:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着我要吃了所有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then I'm gonna eat everyone…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.23,0:13:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打过招呼的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}you ever said hello to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.65,0:13:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇塞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hot damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.88,0:13:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这招不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's somethin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.22,0:13:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我标记了你们的克隆人犯事的城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}I marked all the towns your stunt doubles hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.48,0:14:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样你可以找出规律\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you can see the pattern.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.52,0:14:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.50,0:14:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么样的规律呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, so, what is the pattern?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.04,0:14:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道啊 哥们 我看不出\N{\fnArial\fs30}No clue, man. I can't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.96,0:14:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,看上去是随机的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems random.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.98,0:14:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,专家意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little tip from a pro …
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.19,0:14:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的邪恶分身不可能随机\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no such thing as a random series.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.39,0:14:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,挑地方抢劫杀人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}of robbery murders by your evil twins.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.51,0:14:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,给自己吃点兴奋剂 再好好研究一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, have yourself some uppers and look at that some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.37,0:14:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.51,0:14:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 弗兰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.75,0:14:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢什么 把你们送上死路\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what? Sending you to your death?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.86,0:14:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的克隆人想办法被拍下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your doubles want to be on "candid camera, "
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.06,0:14:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好让你们置身水深火热之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}put you in the line of fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.50,0:14:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,换了我就低调点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I'd lay low,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.75,0:14:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我热爱生活和它道不尽的神秘感\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I love life and its infinite mysteries.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.15,0:14:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩想当傻瓜 没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you two want to be dumb, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.35,0:14:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少也把你们的车扔掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least have the common sense to ditch your car.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.80,0:14:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, excuse me. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.23,0:14:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的克隆人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your doublemints …
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.75,0:14:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们开的车和外面那辆一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're using a car just like the one outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.95,0:14:51.29,Note,0,0,0,0,,（杀手二人组仍然在逃）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.35,0:15:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.11,0:15:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来这搞什么鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.24,0:15:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是魅力无穷 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're all charm, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.26,0:15:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的心理医生也一直这么跟我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}So my therapist keeps telling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.63,0:15:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么找到我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you find me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.97,0:15:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个警察 记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a cop, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.84,0:15:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不打算邀请我进去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna invite me in?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.34,0:15:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能不会想进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you may not want me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.65,0:15:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抓了个食人怪放楼下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got one of the big mouths downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.03,0:15:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我不到楼下去就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I won't go downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.67,0:15:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.84,0:15:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想来谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to come thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.04,0:15:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.19,0:15:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, yeah…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.36,0:15:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为商店里写有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seeing as they were fresh out of.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.61,0:15:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,「感谢你把我从吃肝脏的医生手里救出来」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Thanks for saving me from liver-eating surgeon"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.43,0:15:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,的卡片卖光了\N{\fnArial\fs30}cards at the store.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.03,0:15:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个啊 那是我的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that. Just doing my job,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.03,0:15:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没工资\N{\fnArial\fs30}which nobody pays me for.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.72,0:15:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.51,0:15:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最近怎么样 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing, Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.19,0:16:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.59,0:16:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,对生命充满感激\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every day is a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.50,0:16:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的房子刚被烧毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your house just burned down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.49,0:16:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也看见了 我还没露宿街头\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you can see, I got a roof over me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.90,0:16:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.31,0:16:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,就允许别人哪怕善待你五分钟好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let someone be nice to you for five minutes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.94,0:16:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.95,0:16:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是别太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not too nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.29,0:16:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能变软了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't be going soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.66,0:16:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.73,0:16:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会做饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.64,0:16:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,八九不离十吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ish. You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.10,0:16:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如我帮你做点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you let me make you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.21,0:16:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的新家打理一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe put this new place of yours in some kind of order.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.87,0:16:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我干吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.18,0:16:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我欠你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I owe you that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.32,0:16:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 谢谢 警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Thanks, Sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.62,0:16:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,喊我乔迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jody.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.49,0:17:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得会有那么简单吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you think it would be that easy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.72,0:17:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.55,0:17:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这是个开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's a start.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.95,0:17:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.41,0:17:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,要知道他们装成我们的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it's bad enough that they're ganking people,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.92,0:17:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,四处杀人就够可恶了\N{\fnArial\fs30}wearing our mugs,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.29,0:17:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在又来这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}but now this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.93,0:17:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们开着这辆…卡布德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have us driving around in this…Caboodle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.50,0:17:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,却把我的爱车锁起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}while baby's on lockdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.99,0:17:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都是暂时的 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's temporary, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.05,0:17:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能委屈我的爱车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody puts baby in a corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.93,0:17:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这…这台词是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y-you know that's a line from …
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.57,0:17:54.07,Title,0,0,0,0,,斯威兹的电影（《终极豪情》中的抢劫犯） 斯威兹总能化险为夷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swayze movie. Swayze always gets a pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.29,0:17:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.22,0:17:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想来点音乐什么的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, well, you want some tunes or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.57,0:18:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 兄弟 我…我 - 让它放吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry, man, I-I… - Just leave it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.16,0:18:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能就这么一首歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably gonna be the only thing on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.98,0:19:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 - 怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.70,0:19:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶利哥 白衣女鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jericho … the lady in white.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.07,0:19:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑水山脉 食人魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blackwater … wendigo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.18,0:19:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼莱托克湖 湖里的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lake Manitoc … the kid in the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.70,0:19:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们去的都是我们干过活的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're hitting towns we've worked jobs in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.51,0:19:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是按顺序来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}In order.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.63,0:19:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,从我跟着你离开斯坦福大学的那天起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since the day I left Stanford with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.17,0:19:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么情况 他们希望我们找到他们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, they want us to find them?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.91,0:19:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个证实的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, one way to find out …
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.12,0:19:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一件案子是在 圣路易斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}next case would be in…St. Louis.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.01,0:19:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了 康纳餐馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect. Connor's Diner.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.11,0:19:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣路易斯最好吃的汉堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best burgers in St. Louis.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.74,0:19:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也该享受点生命中美好的事物了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I deserve something good in my life right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.15,0:19:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他每天都要吃一个这种东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, he has one of these every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.73,0:19:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且在他心里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in his heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.87,0:19:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他觉得这些东西跟性爱一样美妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}he thinks they're almost as good as sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.57,0:19:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}This…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.57,0:19:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,真恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}is disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.42,0:20:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,死掉的植物还有奶油一样的黏状物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead plants with creamy goo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.09,0:20:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,就好像在吃自以为是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like eating self-righteousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.37,0:20:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来告诉我哪件事更悲剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you tell me which is worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.73,0:20:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 我真是 你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, honestly, I just… You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.28,0:20:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真受不了这家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't stand the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.76,0:20:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,还说什么英雄情结\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk about a hero complex.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.77,0:20:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他连恋人都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he doesn't have relationships.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.09,0:20:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他能去当圣徒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he has applications for Sainthood.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.35,0:20:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有他觉得自己很搞笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and he thinks he's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.03,0:20:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他觉得自己是郭德纲呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}He thinks he's a damn comedian.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.13,0:20:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,疯癫二逼青年何处找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who has two thumbs and full-blown bats in the belfry?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.97,0:20:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.93,0:20:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,脑子里净是路西法的身影\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nothing but Satan-vision on the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.88,0:20:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不明白他心里乱的魂肉都要分离了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, how he's walking around in a jacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.39,0:20:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,还怎么穿着这件夹克到处乱晃\N{\fnArial\fs30}with detachable arms is beyond me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.19,0:20:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾有个兄弟也有这么多麻烦事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I had a brother with this many issues once.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.14,0:20:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗 - 知道我干了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah? - Know what I did?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.45,0:20:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我吃了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.48,0:20:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.29,0:20:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些家伙怎么会是个威胁呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are these guys even a threat?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.09,0:20:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,老大说他们得死 他们就得死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boss says they gotta go, they gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.01,0:20:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.81,0:20:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.00,0:20:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想不想来交换一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna trade?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.03,0:20:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,比起这疯子我宁可要搞笑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I'll take chuckles over schizo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.34,0:20:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 我更喜欢这家伙的头发\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I like this one's hair better.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.14,0:20:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是待在你那个大家伙的身体里吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can stay in the big one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.59,0:20:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 既然如此 那我们就搞点动静出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. In that case, let's turn up the heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.47,0:21:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我越早离开这躯壳找个更稳定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sooner I get out of this and into something more stable,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.54,0:21:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,就越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.17,0:21:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.91,0:21:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,小伙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, kid. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.55,0:21:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不如打开那东西上的摄像头吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you fire up the camera on that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.63,0:21:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它对准这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Point it over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.71,0:21:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.40,0:21:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都冷静点 我们是来抢劫的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, everybody be cool! This is a robbery!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.95,0:21:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人动的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody moves,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.38,0:21:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就杀光你们每一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll execute every last one of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.96,0:21:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,砍下他们的头杀不了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Choppin' their heads off won't kill 'em,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.77,0:21:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过也能很有效地拖延他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it'll slow 'em down pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.22,0:21:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过头还会再粘回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Till they fuse back up, anyhow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.15,0:21:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,也算是有点进展了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's something, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.57,0:21:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我们还未必能靠近他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, assuming we can even get close to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.83,0:21:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 我也不想你们走到他们跟前去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me, I don't want you walking right up to 'em, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.80,0:21:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还在找你们能用来射杀他们的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still looking for something you can shoot at 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.99,0:21:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好时光啊 谢了 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good times. All right, thanks, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.54,0:21:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吃蛋黄酱的对吧 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you take mayo, right, Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.16,0:21:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那里有个小妞吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a chick over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.88,0:21:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.94,0:22:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.69,0:22:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在办事吗 理查德·基尔（好莱坞男演员）\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you even working, Richard Gere?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.57,0:22:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 你个白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up, you idjit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.99,0:22:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们兄弟俩接着去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you boys off to next?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.57,0:22:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣路易斯 那是我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, St. Louis. That's where we …
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.93,0:22:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,太晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.79,0:22:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们去过圣路易斯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They hit St. Louis.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.01,0:22:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,洗劫了那里的一家餐馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pumpkin-and-Honeybunny'd a diner there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.70,0:22:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,康纳餐馆吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connor's Diner?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.29,0:22:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 你怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. How'd you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.14,0:22:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便猜猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.29,0:22:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so much for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.50,0:22:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们要去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess we're off to…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.24,0:22:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱荷华州安克尼市\N{\fnArial\fs30}To Ankeny, Iowa.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.53,0:22:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你有所收获 打电话给我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call us if you get anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.21,0:22:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.18,0:22:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是莫瑞斯和瓦伦提特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Special agents Morris, Valente.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.17,0:22:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是最先到案发现场的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were first on the scene?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.68,0:22:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,很不幸 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.99,0:22:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不要告诉我们发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanna tell us what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.46,0:23:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那东西拿好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey, hey, hey, hey! Keep that up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.07,0:23:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没说你能把它放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't say you could put that down!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.13,0:23:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要让全世界都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want the whole world to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.45,0:23:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆和迪恩·温彻斯特能做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what Sam and Dean Winchester are capable of.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.77,0:23:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀光了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That all of 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.97,0:23:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,还差一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}All but one.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.07,0:23:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 拜托 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, please, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.22,0:23:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 圣路易斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, goodnight, St. Louis.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.20,0:23:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们真是棒极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been a wonderful crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.87,0:23:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱荷华州的人们 快逃吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab your socks and hose, Iowa,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.87,0:23:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们接着就要朝你们那里去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause we're headed to you next.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.57,0:23:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要警告\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to alert …
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.68,0:23:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦 州和当地警局 这就去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Federal, state, local … I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.08,0:24:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这幅躯壳有没有让我看起来很胖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does this skin make me look fat?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.51,0:24:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.76,0:24:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,记忆挺晦暗啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's pretty dark in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.88,0:24:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,高中辍学\N{\fnArial\fs30}High-school dropout.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.51,0:24:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个酒鬼老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}A drunk like your daddy before you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.50,0:24:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和你爸都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. You and dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.65,0:24:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是一丘之貉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that's a can of scorpions.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.64,0:24:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最爱的歌手是琼尼·米歇尔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your favorite singer is Joni Frickin' Mitchell?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.24,0:24:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.93,0:24:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的忧郁都要兜不住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are 10 pounds of sad in a 5-pound bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.26,0:24:41.96,Note,0,0,0,0,,（安克尼旅馆）
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.21,0:24:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆 萨姆 站好别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, Sam. Hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.09,0:24:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动 别乱动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move. Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.21,0:25:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,别啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.06,0:25:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是太过分了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is all sorts of wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.34,0:25:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那车可真不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are nice wheels.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.66,0:25:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,等事情结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell you what, when this is over,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.30,0:25:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把车偷过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm stealing those rims.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.87,0:25:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟孩子们问声好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell the kids I said hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.41,0:25:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.52,0:25:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 我们找到他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, we got eyes on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.98,0:25:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.92,0:25:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直像照镜子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like looking at a funhouse mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.82,0:25:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了解你的感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know the feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.43,0:25:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我们你有收获了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, tell me you got something.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.77,0:25:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我们就要近身战了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otherwise, we're gonna have to get in close.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.45,0:25:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 先原地等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, just hang back for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.47,0:25:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,太晚了 我们必须…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too late. We gotta …
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.93,0:25:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.79,0:25:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,举起手来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hands in the air!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.01,0:25:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你误会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.56,0:25:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们要抓的人 - 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look, the guys you want - shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.32,0:25:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们就在那边 你们转过去 - 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- they're right there. Just turn around. - Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.60,0:25:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看啊 - 放下电话 高举双手\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look. - Drop the phone. Put your hands in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.60,0:25:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.58,0:25:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.51,0:25:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要说你啊 鲍比 - 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know the thing about you, Bobby… - Save it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.34,0:25:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了解我自己 帅哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already know me, handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.37,0:25:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一副粗声粗气的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got the gruff thing down.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.00,0:26:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,见证了无数的死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seen more death than an electric chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.36,0:26:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,随时准备战死沙场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready to die with your boots on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.94,0:26:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是 在你的内心深处\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, you know, deep down inside…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.14,0:26:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是那么的愤世嫉俗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're no cynic.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.78,0:26:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是有希望的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.91,0:26:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至对楼上的小姐还有点意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}You even got a thing for that lady upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.96,0:26:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你心里有那么一小块想着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tiny part of you thinks,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.94,0:26:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.02,0:26:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着一切都过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}after this is all done,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.17,0:26:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟我们的警长小姐可以在树林深处\N{\fnArial\fs30}you and miss sheriff can make your own little cabin.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.52,0:26:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,建个自己的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.69,0:26:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是可笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.46,0:26:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你连明天早上的太阳都看不到了 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not getting any older than tomorrow, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.07,0:26:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,何必费这个心呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you bother?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.60,0:26:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢勃朗宁的诗吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You a Browning fan?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.68,0:26:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come again?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.88,0:26:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伯特·勃朗宁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Robert Browning.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.67,0:26:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,诗人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poet.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.54,0:26:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有在我的思维和情感中\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got that name rattling around up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.96,0:26:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到他的名字吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the rest of my thoughts and feelings?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.84,0:26:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总是醉得不省人事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kind of hard to sift through.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.71,0:26:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,找东西可有点困难 不过…\N{\fnArial\fs30}all the drunken blackouts, but …
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.91,0:26:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,「人要追求自己得不到的东西」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"A man's reach should exceed his grasp."
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.14,0:26:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢这句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.02,0:27:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来棒极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's actually lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.90,0:27:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,勃朗宁是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Browning?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.14,0:27:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我吃了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}After I eat you,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.16,0:27:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝对会去图书馆看他的书\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm definitely gonna hit the library.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.69,0:27:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么鬼东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.85,0:27:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它弄掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.08,0:27:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它弄掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.13,0:27:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它弄掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it off!!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.49,0:27:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它从我身上弄掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it off of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.19,0:27:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它从我身上弄掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.19,0:27:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 这儿有点小乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sorry. Little snafu here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.76,0:27:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可真是意料之外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, wasn't expecting that reaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.30,0:27:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,水桶里边是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was in that bucket?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.48,0:27:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们搞错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you're making a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.85,0:27:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的凶手还在餐厅里 懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The real killers are back at the diner, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.57,0:27:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你无力的辩解吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that the best you can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.67,0:27:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want my phone call.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.82,0:27:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有电话的 不过是给联调局的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, there'll be a call, to the FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.59,0:27:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他关进一号囚室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take him to cell number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.06,0:27:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,带这个去审讯室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take that one to the interview room.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.69,0:27:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们分开关好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once they're separate and secure,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.17,0:27:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们今晚就可以收工了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you boys call it a night.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.51,0:27:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们弄错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're making a mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.02,0:28:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩忘了什么东西了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, did you guys forget something or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.72,0:28:29.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（安克尼 警长办公室）
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.30,0:28:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有权打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. I have a right to my phone call.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.21,0:28:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,权利\N{\fnArial\fs30}A right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.01,0:28:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你过去的几天杀了多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed how many people last couple days,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.03,0:28:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,居然还敢让我来帮你实现权利\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you want me to hop-to on your rights?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.90,0:28:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't …
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.36,0:28:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please …
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.64,0:28:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,就让我打一个电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just give me one … one phone call.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.63,0:28:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩儿们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boys?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.63,0:28:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 我们被抓了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, we got popped.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.94,0:28:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我会马上过来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I'll be there as soon as …
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.05,0:28:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了 没时间 我们看到他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, there's no time. Look, we saw them…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.14,0:28:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也看到我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They saw us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.74,0:28:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此 「我们」要来找我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we are coming to get us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.39,0:28:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You read me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.32,0:29:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me you got something.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.59,0:29:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,一种化学成分\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a chemical …
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.10,0:29:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,硼酸钠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sodium borate.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.76,0:29:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我要去问百度知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let me get Mr.Wizard on speed dial.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.57,0:29:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 这挺靠谱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, it ain't as weird as it sounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.41,0:29:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,化工清洁剂 肥皂还有洗衣粉\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's found in industrial cleaners and soaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.84,0:29:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}and laundry powder.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.26,0:29:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,找那些带硼酸字样的产品就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just look for anything with the word borax on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.70,0:29:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我当绝望主妇对付这帮怪物吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to "Desperate Housewife" these mothers?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.70,0:29:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 相信我就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, just trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.37,0:29:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西能烧伤他们 足够拖延时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It burns 'em bad enough to slow 'em down.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.57,0:29:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,找剂量最大的那种 懂了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So get the strongest you can find. Hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.83,0:29:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,硼酸 烧伤 懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Borax. Burns. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.72,0:29:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后泼向他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then douse 'em,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.50,0:29:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠近 砍下他们的脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}then get close, and then chop the heads off.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.14,0:29:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.08,0:29:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,把脑袋单独放置\N{\fnArial\fs30}And keep the heads separate!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.72,0:29:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 你是个天才 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, you're a genius. Thanks. I …
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.30,0:29:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛挂电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd you do that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.21,0:29:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,硼酸 斩首\N{\fnArial\fs30}Borax? Decapitation?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.65,0:29:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和你朋友都是些什么疯子啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of sickos are you and your friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.82,0:29:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.26,0:29:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不马上去把那东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't go get every ounce,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.04,0:29:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,能找到的每一滴\N{\fnArial\fs30}every drop of whatever that stuff is.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.28,0:29:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,都搜集来\N{\fnArial\fs30}in this place right now…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.60,0:29:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.12,0:29:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你比我想象的还疯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're crazier than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.77,0:30:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.91,0:30:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.96,0:30:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在可没时间吃饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have time for lunch right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.38,0:30:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我饿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.45,0:30:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,等会的 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Later. let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.33,0:30:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.92,0:30:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.97,0:30:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…it's just…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.23,0:30:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道刚才看到的是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what I just saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.00,0:30:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,放我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.75,0:30:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,照我说的做 咱们都可以活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you listen to me, and we'll live.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.86,0:30:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,悄悄地到补给柜子那去\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, keep your head down, get to the supply closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.91,0:30:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿来所有带有硼酸字样的物品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get anything that says borax on it … bring it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.15,0:30:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now. go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.52,0:30:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.92,0:31:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是你哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.42,0:31:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我近似迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I am Dean adjacent.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.38,0:31:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.52,0:31:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,小萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.03,0:31:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是小萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.79,0:31:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to let you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.92,0:31:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从变成你们以来\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much I've really grown to hate.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.36,0:31:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是越来越狠你俩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you and your brother since we've been wearing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.15,0:31:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.00,0:31:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们前途无量\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could be anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.06,0:31:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,强壮 无牵无挂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're strong. You're uninhibited.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.55,0:31:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,信不信由你 还挺聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're smart enough, believe it or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.96,0:31:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你们太在意做个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're so caught up in being good.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.97,0:31:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,和照顾彼此了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and taking care of each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.76,0:31:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,关你什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you care?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.61,0:31:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这让我生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it pisses me off!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.36,0:32:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你浪费了一个绝佳的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wasting a perfectly good opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.36,0:32:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,征服弱者的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}to subjugate the weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.65,0:32:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,真萌 你根本无法靠近我 怎么用得上那东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cute. Really think you can get close enough to use it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.85,0:32:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你烧伤了我就能了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not until you're burning.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.54,0:32:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.74,0:32:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.10,0:32:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,认为你是个疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}…thinks you're nutballs.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.63,0:32:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他认为你崩溃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He thinks you're off your game.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.05,0:32:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是想杀我吗 还是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna kill me, or is.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.00,0:32:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你所谓的 饭前消遣\N{\fnArial\fs30}this some sort of "play with your food" bull?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.44,0:32:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.88,0:32:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.13,0:32:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这就是为什么迪恩不告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I guess that's why dean never told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.26,0:32:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他杀了艾米\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he killed amy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.09,0:32:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.04,0:33:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你那表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}The look on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.52,0:33:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是太完美了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is priceless!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.69,0:33:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是等这个呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I've been waiting for.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.38,0:33:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我能吃你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I can eat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.25,0:33:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause, you see,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.01,0:33:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢有点苦味的肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like my meat a little bitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.53,0:33:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这感觉不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that felt good.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.41,0:33:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.65,0:33:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦调查局正在赶来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The FBI is on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.34,0:33:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个 关于这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, listen, about that…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.21,0:33:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论你们要我做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever I can do…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.58,0:33:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我隐瞒刚刚发生的一切更不在话下\N{\fnArial\fs30}especially if it involves lying about everything I just saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.18,0:33:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.56,0:33:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是希望你能让我们 死掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was hoping you could help us kind of… be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.20,0:33:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,打引号的那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, quote unquote.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.41,0:33:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.32,0:33:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我应该可以做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I should be able to swing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.76,0:33:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.45,0:34:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 拿拖把擦地了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's grab a mop.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.01,0:34:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,小萨姆 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy? you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.04,0:34:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.84,0:34:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.91,0:34:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就在这时先发制人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's when I got the drop on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.00,0:34:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后将他俩击毙\N{\fnArial\fs30}and shot them both.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.79,0:34:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做的很好 警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did good, sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.08,0:34:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,档案在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's the files.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.24,0:34:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,死因 多处枪伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause of death … multiple gunshot wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.25,0:34:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 我先采取了指纹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I fingerprinted them first, of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.84,0:34:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,以便存档记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}for your records.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.96,0:34:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能看看尸体吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind if we take a look at the bodies?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.59,0:34:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的尸体已经送殡仪馆火化了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their bodies were sent to the funeral home for cremation,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.18,0:34:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他们的生前遗愿和宗教需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}as per their living wills and religious requirements.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.85,0:34:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还真是效率\N{\fnArial\fs30}That must be some kind of record.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.35,0:34:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们昨晚才死\N{\fnArial\fs30}They died last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.80,0:34:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以联系下殡仪馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can contact the funeral home.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.86,0:34:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们没准还留着尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}They might still have the bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.41,0:34:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 当做完尸检\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you know, once we do the autopsy,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.39,0:34:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就要释放\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're obliged to release …
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.76,0:34:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你毁掉了尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had the bodies destroyed?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.02,0:34:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这算哪门子的暗箱操作啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of backwater operation is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.28,0:34:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,别激动 算了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy. Forget about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.01,0:34:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没尸体 无报告 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No bodies, no paperwork, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.49,0:34:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人跟我说过这是件好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone once told me that was a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.96,0:34:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好消息还是好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}The good news still stands.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.71,0:35:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这案件结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This case is closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.56,0:35:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆和迪恩·温彻斯特死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam and dean winchester are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.37,0:35:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,温彻斯特兄弟的杀人狂旅在爱荷华血腥终结\N{\fnArial\fs30}The winchester crime spree has come to a violent end in iowa,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.14,0:35:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,两人皆被击毙\N{\fnArial\fs30}where they were gunned down.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.48,0:35:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样就能消停一段日子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That should take the heat off. For now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.68,0:35:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 乔迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Jody.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.32,0:35:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没你可真不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couldn't have done it without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.71,0:35:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,再要我帮什么忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anytime you need me to spill something else,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.72,0:35:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,打个电话就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you give me a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.09,0:35:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上 还有件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, there is one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.12,0:35:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,别打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.93,0:35:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算他说话也别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if it starts talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.57,0:35:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别是他说话的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially if it starts talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.61,0:35:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你路过山下的桥时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you cross over underhill bridge,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.60,0:35:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,扔到河里就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}just toss it in the drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.68,0:35:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得失陪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you'll excuse me,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.70,0:35:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还要往水泥里埋一具尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, um…I got a body to bury in cement.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.78,0:36:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 你不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.78,0:36:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,向联邦调查局撒谎 焚化尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lying to the FBI, incinerating bodies,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.08,0:36:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有这玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.52,0:36:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.42,0:36:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这肯定不是血\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause it sure isn't blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.13,0:36:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right about that, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.78,0:36:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,远不止血那么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's much more than blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.19,0:36:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.22,0:36:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,没必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.96,0:36:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是瓦伦丁\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Valente.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.40,0:36:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 头儿 他们就在我手边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir, I'm with them now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.92,0:37:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不幸的是 他们的头…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, unfortunately, their heads are…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.52,0:37:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.19,0:37:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真正的温家双煞死了 对吗 - 没有 头儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But the actual Winchesters are dead, yes? - No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.93,0:37:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们跑路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're in the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.21,0:37:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说 用了那么多人和资源\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, all that brainpower, all those resources,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.34,0:37:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那两只田鼠还逍遥在外吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and those two field mice are still on my to-do list?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.38,0:37:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉 头儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.64,0:37:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿到更多DNA后 再伪装成他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could grab some more DNA and double them again.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.37,0:37:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这想法不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like where your head's at,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.69,0:37:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过有的计不能反复施\N{\fnArial\fs30}but sometimes less is more.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.03,0:37:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们又死而复生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those boys coming back from the dead again.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.08,0:37:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,就难以让人相信了\N{\fnArial\fs30}starts to strain credulity,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.71,0:37:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使美国媒体也会怀疑的 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}even for the American media, am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.29,0:37:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 头儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.60,0:37:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,行事要隐秘\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like a subtler approach.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.06,0:37:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,此事须回正规\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back to the vision board on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.88,0:37:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.12,0:37:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护好尸体 回联调局来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just secure the bodies and get back to the FBI,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.83,0:37:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们再议温家双煞一事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we'll give this Winchester situation a good think.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.14,0:37:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定的 谢谢 头儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Definitely. Thanks, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.76,0:37:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有瓦伦提\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, Valente?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.05,0:37:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次 我要听到好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next time, call me with a win.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.96,0:37:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好自为之\N{\fnArial\fs30}For your sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.32,0:37:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,别逼我对你动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't make me bib you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.14,0:37:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 头儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.42,0:37:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想喝拿铁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm craving a Latte.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.85,0:37:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能去街对面买杯来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mind running across the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.02,0:37:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们再出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}before we hit the trail?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.99,0:38:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,无咖啡因 双份香草\N{\fnArial\fs30}Decaf, two pumps of vanilla,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.07,0:38:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己也随便买点 我请客\N{\fnArial\fs30}and grab yourself whatever you want … my treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.59,0:38:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗曼先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Roman.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.05,0:38:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想是时候来见见你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I felt it was time we met in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.18,0:38:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.66,0:38:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱之主\N{\fnArial\fs30}I run hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.74,0:38:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 当然 我完全同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, yes. Of course. I agree, 100%.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.31,0:38:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是该见见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}High time we met.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.79,0:38:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不成敬意\N{\fnArial\fs30}A token.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.31,0:38:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,太客气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.45,0:38:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢松糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love a muffin.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.01,0:38:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,纯有机婴儿小舌\N{\fnArial\fs30}100% organic baby uvulas …
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.07,0:38:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不含麸质\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gluten free.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.10,0:38:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,太周到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So considerate.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.97,0:38:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就开门见山了 罗曼先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll cut to the chase, Mr. Roman.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.08,0:38:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,请叫我迪克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.54,0:38:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.64,0:38:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你我各自掌控着极大利益\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I control large interests.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.67,0:38:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我坚信可以强强联合\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I feel strongly could meld,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.81,0:38:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,从此皆大欢喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the benefit of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.78,0:38:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你这么想吗 - 我确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You think? - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.67,0:38:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,坦率说 我们应当成为朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Straight talk … we should be friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.45,0:38:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.54,0:38:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.77,0:39:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为什么该做朋友呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why in the world would we be?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.38,0:39:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我把你带到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I brought you here…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.62,0:39:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.91,0:39:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到了打开炼狱之门的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found the way to open the door to purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.20,0:39:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是为了窃取那里的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}To steal every last soul, you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.45,0:39:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和你那个天使朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and that angel friend of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.26,0:39:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,别一边忽悠我 还说是为了我好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't roofie me and call it romance.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.38,0:39:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你误解我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you've got me wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.69,0:39:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你给我听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now it's your turn to listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.41,0:39:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我宁愿在垃圾堆里打滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd sooner swim through hot garbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.01,0:39:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不要和你这种下贱的怪物握手言和\N{\fnArial\fs30}than shake hands with a bottom-feeding mutation like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.85,0:39:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们恶魔都是丑陋 懒惰 拜金的婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You demons are ugly, lazy, gold-digging whores.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.89,0:39:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还不如人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're less than humans,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.92,0:39:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他们也只有蘸着蒜酱\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they're not good for much.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.06,0:39:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,才算有点用处\N{\fnArial\fs30}till you dip 'em in garlic sauce.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.23,0:39:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远不会跟你合作 克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd never work with you, Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.77,0:39:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 如果我不是忙着做其他事\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, if I wasn't busy with better things,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.54,0:39:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就把你们从宇宙中彻底消灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}I might actively wipe your kind from the face of the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.35,0:39:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样也是你们活该\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you'd deserve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.39,0:39:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.96,0:39:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,松糕留着吃吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep the muffins.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.04,0:40:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定要把这些丢掉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure you want to dump these things?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.61,0:40:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我估计后面说不定能派上用场呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thinking they might actually come in handy down the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.92,0:40:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.84,0:40:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么了 什么事 说啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What is it? Talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.00,0:40:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.28,0:40:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你指望我信吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's convincing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.06,0:40:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪物版的我们把你吓傻了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did monster-us give you the jeebs, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.54,0:40:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I gotta be honest …
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.43,0:40:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可得有日子不去照镜子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't looking in the mirror for … for a while myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.64,0:40:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.91,0:40:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真想知道我哪里不对劲吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really want to know what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.11,0:40:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.02,0:40:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 你知道我的座右铭 为人民服务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you know my motto … here to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.20,0:40:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,「为人民服务」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Here to help."
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.16,0:40:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你是怎么对艾米的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of like you helped Amy?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.39,0:40:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, Sam…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.32,0:40:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,别…别再对我撒谎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't … don't lie to me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.21,0:40:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 别再跟我讲话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, don't even talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.27,0:40:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.83,0:41:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what, Dean? I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.86,0:41:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做不到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't what?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.01,0:41:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在不能跟你讲话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't talk to you right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.35,0:41:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪恩 我现在甚至不能跟你呆在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I can't even be around you right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.29,0:41:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so …
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.57,0:41:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你还是一个人走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I think you should just go on without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.98,0:41:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.68,0:41:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.81,0:41:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Sam.
